WEBVTT

00:42:28.690 --> 00:42:31.588
For the conference call in real life,
thanks to Tripp Crosby.

00:42:31.612 --> 00:42:34.146
For the snippets of what it's like
to work from home,

00:42:34.170 --> 00:42:37.426
thanks to Jason Gates, Ryan Smith,
Amanda Monday, Danielle Tussing,

00:42:37.450 --> 00:42:39.196
Erin Kahana, Tiffany Chang,

00:42:39.220 --> 00:42:41.696
John Mi, Aaron Guo, Next Plumbing

00:42:41.720 --> 00:42:44.896
and everyone else who called in
to share their stories with us.

00:42:44.920 --> 00:42:47.720
For their research, thanks to
Bob Ginnett on airline crews,

00:42:47.744 --> 00:42:49.901
Cameron Klein and colleagues
on team building,

00:42:49.925 --> 00:42:51.676
Ashley Hardin on personal knowledge,

00:42:51.700 --> 00:42:54.126
Jeremy Bailenson on giant virtual heads,

00:42:54.150 --> 00:42:57.486
Yaacov Trope and Nira Liberman
on mental time travel,

00:42:57.510 --> 00:43:00.826
Kate Sweeny and Michael Dooley
on worrying versus rumination,